@Idfy.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5142
@apiKey = your-api-key

# All endpoints below require the x-api-key header (add it in each request or via a shared header).

### Validate by URL / Base64
# docType (optional): ind_pan | ind_aadhaar | ind_voter_id | ind_driving_license | ind_passport
# Detect* flags need their key names set under Idfy:AdvancedFeatureKeys.
POST {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/validate
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": "https://example.com/pan.jpg",
  "docType": "ind_pan",
  "detectDocSide": true,
  "detectFace": true,
  "detectScanned": true
}

### Validate by file upload
POST {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/documents/validate/upload
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="pan.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./pan.jpg
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="docType"

ind_pan
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="detectFace"

true
--boundary--

### PAN extraction (OCR) by URL / Base64
POST {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pan/extract
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": "https://example.com/pan.jpg"
}

### PAN extraction (OCR) by file upload
POST {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/pan/extract/upload
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="pan.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./pan.jpg
--boundary--

### Aadhaar extraction (OCR) by URL / Base64 - consent required
POST {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/aadhaar/extract
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": "https://example.com/aadhaar.jpg",
  "consent": true
}

### Aadhaar extraction (OCR) by file upload - consent required
POST {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/aadhaar/extract/upload
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="aadhaar.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./aadhaar.jpg
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="consent"

true
--boundary--

### Driving-license extraction (OCR) by URL / Base64
POST {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/driving-license/extract
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": "https://example.com/dl.jpg"
}

### Driving-license extraction (OCR) by file upload
POST {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/driving-license/extract/upload
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="dl.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./dl.jpg
--boundary--

### Passport extraction (OCR) by URL / Base64 - document2 (back page) optional
POST {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/passport/extract
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": "https://example.com/passport-front.jpg",
  "document2": "https://example.com/passport-back.jpg"
}

### Passport extraction (OCR) by file upload - file2 (back page) optional
POST {{Idfy.Api_HostAddress}}/api/passport/extract/upload
x-api-key: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="front.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./front.jpg
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file2"; filename="back.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./back.jpg
--boundary--

###
